
  Use a cache · Add an index · Leave as is                                
                                                                          
  ▸ Use a cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  + Pros                                − Cons                            
  • One-line change, no schema          • Stale reads after a write       
    change                                                                
  • cache/ is not needed to run the                                       
    app                                                                   
                                                                          
  ▸ Add an index ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  + Pros                                − Cons                            
  • Keeps reads exact                   • Slower writes                   
  • Helps every query on the column                                       
                                                                          
  ▸ Leave as is ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  + Pros                                − Cons                            
  • Nothing to do                       • Slow page loads stay, for every 
                                          user                            

